      "matters": "ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE FOR CHANGE OF NAME<br>Off Calendar Aug-29-2013 Granted Per Written Order<br>MINI MINUTES: This cause came on regularly as scheduled this day for OSC hearing for Name Change.<br>Dept. 514, Judge: Donald Sullivan, Clerk: Yolanda Mazariegos, CSR: Sonia Wong, #11288.<br>Petitioner Tsung-Han Yang present in court.<br>Petitioner sworn and examined. <br>Proof of Publication on file.<br><br>No objections to the proposed change of name were made at the hearing.<br>It appears to the satisfaction of the Court that all the allegations in the petition are true, correct and sufficient, and the petition should be granted.<br>The court grants the petition for Change of Name to Matthew Tsung-Hang Yang.<br>Decree Changing Name signed in open court.<br>",
      "location": "CIVIC CENTER COURTHOUSE ROOM 514",
